  "description": "<p>According to the Fedora 6 documentation, a RemoteIpValve must be configured in Tomcat if Fedora is run behind a reverse proxy:</p>\n\n<div class=\"code panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent\">\n<pre class=\"code-xml\">&lt;Valve className=<span class=\"code-quote\">\"org.apache.catalina.valves.RemoteIpValve\"</span>\n       protocolHeader=<span class=\"code-quote\">\"X-Forwarded-Proto\"</span> /&gt;</pre>\n</div></div>",
